-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §8 אופן ההעסקה במילוי מקום: in תשע"ב–תשע"ד a
-- substitute who also teaches for the same employer keeps his own terms;
-- one who does not takes the terms of the teacher he replaces in weekly
-- hours, subject to §7(ח), and otherwise is off the reform.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-7`

§ `8 אופן ההעסקה במילוי מקום`

@desc A teaching employee employed as a substitute, as far as §8 asks.
DECLARE `Oz substitution` HAS
    `the school year`                              IS A NUMBER @desc by the calendar year it opens in: 2011 is תשע"ב
    `qualifications`                               IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
    `also teaches for the employer, not as a substitute` IS A BOOLEAN
    `his terms outside the substitution`           IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
    `placed in weekly hours in another teacher's place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc maternity leave, reserve duty, long illness, a work accident and the like
    `the replaced teacher's terms`                 IS A `extent of the Oz reform`

-- ¶1 opens the rules for the school years תשע"ב–תשע"ד; it says nothing of
-- a later year, when every teaching employee is under the reform (§7(ז)).
-- (א): one who also teaches for the same employer, not as a substitute,
-- substitutes on his own terms there, under the reform or off it.
-- (ב): one who does not: (1) placed in weekly hours in another teacher's
-- place, he takes that teacher's terms, subject to §7(ח); (2) otherwise,
-- off the reform.
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8__para_a akn:art_8__para_b akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN s IS A `Oz substitution`
GIVETH A MAYBE `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `the terms of a substitute under section 8` s IS
    IF `the school year` (s's `the school year`) `is from` `the school year 5772` `to` `the school year 5774`
    THEN JUST terms
    ELSE NOTHING
    WHERE
        terms MEANS
            BRANCH
                IF s's `also teaches for the employer, not as a substitute` THEN s's `his terms outside the substitution`
                IF s's `placed in weekly hours in another teacher's place`
                   AND NOT `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` (s's `qualifications`)
                THEN s's `the replaced teacher's terms`
                OTHERWISE `off the Oz reform`

GIVEN also IS A BOOLEAN, own IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, placed IS A BOOLEAN, replaced IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A `Oz substitution`
DECIDE `a substitution in 5773` also own placed replaced IS
    `Oz substitution` WITH
        `the school year`                              IS `the school year 5773`
        `qualifications`                               IS `the qualifications of a teacher at` 0.5 TRUE TRUE FALSE
        `also teaches for the employer, not as a substitute` IS also
        `his terms outside the substitution`           IS own
        `placed in weekly hours in another teacher's place` IS placed
        `the replaced teacher's terms`                 IS replaced

#ASSERT `the terms of a substitute under section 8` (`a substitution in 5773` TRUE `off the Oz reform` TRUE `the Oz reform in full`) EQUALS JUST `off the Oz reform`
#ASSERT `the terms of a substitute under section 8` (`a substitution in 5773` FALSE `off the Oz reform` TRUE `the Oz reform in full`) EQUALS JUST `the Oz reform in full`
#ASSERT `the terms of a substitute under section 8` (`a substitution in 5773` FALSE `off the Oz reform` FALSE `the Oz reform in full`) EQUALS JUST `off the Oz reform`
